 "coverage": "Mesh covers a square centred on the pole reaching 80 deg S at the edge midpoints (prpds.cat: 'covers a square region centred on the pole to 80 degrees latitude'); the corners reach about 75.9 deg S (first record, tri_clat -75.905). Every region window here lies inside it (largest |x|,|y| about 168 km vs about 300 km half-width).",
 "centre_latitude_range_loaded_deg": [
  -89.992,
  -83.35
